            <ArticleTitle>Release of intracoronary thrombus during coronary arteriography in a patient with unstable angina.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>191-2</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A case of release of an intracoronary thrombus in a patient with unstable angina is presented. The thrombus was observed in the right coronary artery just distal to the severe stenosis and was released during coronary arteriography.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
